OL,3,GNEWSABridge set for 'essential'
OL,4,Astructural repair work
OL,5,
OL,6,FUpgrades to improve the long-term
OL,7,Fdurability of a town's "iconic" bridge
OL,8,Fhave been outlined ahead of work that
OL,9,Fis set to start in 2027.
OL,11,FThe project will see essential
OL,12,Fstructural repairs carried out on areas
OL,13,Fof corrosion on Poole Bridge in Dorset.
OL,15,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,16,F(BCP) Council said with the bridge
OL,17,Fapproaching its centenary year,
OL,18,Fimprovements would "help ensure the
OL,19,Ficonic crossing continues to connect
OL,20,Fcommunities for many decades to come".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
